{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "Tune31 Phase II F / D3.3.3v3, S7.1.3v2, S9.1.3: unannotated float temporaries retain their nullable F64 carrier through a `var` ArrayNum parameter. The COW/bounds/null miss remains on array_num_set_cow_idx; the successful dynamically indexed update stores directly and writes back through the caller home.",
